      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a set of Python files for text-to-speech (TTS) service integrations using Google Cloud Text-to-Speech. I need to create the specified files with the necessary imports and functions to interact with the Google Cloud Text-to-Speech API. Each scored file must use the Google Cloud Text-to-Speech service and make it identifiable in the code. The local helper files will provide configuration and utility functions to support the scored files. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789844200599,
          "start": 1789844191064
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
